        "title": "Search results",
        "text": "International American University (IAU), Los Angeles, California, USA University Partners iau.html Search results International American University International American University Earn Your Honorary Doctorate Degree at IAULA Elevate Your Impact with the Honorary Doctorate Program Understanding the recognition What is an Honorary Doctorate Degree? Securing the Title of “Doctor” Rigorous Nomination and Evaluation Process Nomination & evaluation Formal conferment Join a Legacy of Excellence Take the next step Connect with St. Roberts International College Address Quick Links Gallery Contact Us Visit Us International American University UNIVERSITY PARTNERS · LOS ANGELESInternational American UniversityA trusted Educational Partner of St. Roberts International CollegeExplore IAU ↗Honorary Doctorate Program ↓ International American University Los Angeles Program overviewRecognitionNomination processNominate now HONORARY DOCTORATE PROGRAMEarn Your Honorary Doctorate Degree at IAULAElevate Your Impact with the Honorary Doctorate ProgramInternational American University (IAU), in collaboration with St. Roberts International College (SRIC), proudly invites distinguished individuals to join our prestigious Honorary Doctorate Program. This program is designed to honor those whose remarkable contributions to society reflect innovation and excellence in their respective fields. RECOGNIZING CONTRIBUTIONSUnderstanding the recognitionWhat is an Honorary Doctorate Degree?An Honorary Doctorate degree is an esteemed recognition awarded to individuals who have achieved extraordinary success and impact in their professional careers or through exemplary service to society. This degree acknowledges impactful career achievements and societal contributions, as opposed to traditional academic coursework, elevating the honoree's stature in their field.Securing the Title of “Doctor”Earning an Honorary Doctorate from IAULA secures the title of \"Doctor\" for recipients in their respective fields. This prestigious designation recognizes their outstanding contributions and reinforces their esteemed position within their profession. This title serves as a testament to their leadership, innovation, and commitment to advancing their industry or community. FROM NOMINATION TO CONFERMENTRigorous Nomination and Evaluation Process01Nomination & evaluationOur commitment to excellence ensures that each Honorary Doctorate degree is conferred with the utmost credibility and prestige. Candidates are invited to submit applications for nomination, which undergo a rigorous evaluation by the Academic Senate of International American University. This comprehensive process examines the depth and breadth of the candidate's contributions to ensure only the most deserving are honored.02Formal confermentUpon successful evaluation, recipients of the Honorary Doctorate degree are celebrated in a formal conferment ceremony led by the University President. This momentous occasion symbolizes not only personal achievement but also reinforces the honoree's influence and reputation in their profession. LEADERSHIP & IMPACTJoin a Legacy of ExcellenceHolding an Honorary Doctorate from IAULA is considered a prestigious accolade in any field, especially among practitioners. It serves as public recognition of the honoree’s substantial contributions to their profession and society at large. The conferment of this degree by a reputable institution like IAULA underscores the honoree’s leadership, innovation, and commitment to advancing their field. IAU DEGREE NOMINATION FORMTake the next stepNOMINATE NOW! ↗ GET INVOLVEDConnect with St. Roberts International CollegeContact St. Roberts International College to explore more about the Honorary Doctorate Program. Elevate your achievements and become part of a legacy that honors excellence and impactful contributions.Contact SRIC ↗"
