        "text": "Academic Programs International Business Program / Southern Manila Consortium SHS IBP / SMC ibp-smc.html Search results International Business Program / Southern Manila Consortium International Business Program / Southern Manila Consortium Elementary Department Junior High School Department Senior High School Department Academic Track Tech-Vocational Track Learning options Open High School Program (OHSP) Address Quick Links Gallery Contact Us Visit Us International Business Program / Southern Manila Consortium BASIC EDUCATION · SRIC BED-IBPInternational Business Program / Southern Manila ConsortiumThe International Business Program (IBP) of St. Robert’s International College – Basic Education Department (SRIC BED-IBP) is a comprehensive K–12 academic offering that combines the national curriculum prescribed by the Department of Education (DepEd) with a globally-oriented, specialized curriculum. This unique academic design aims to nurture academic excellence, 21st-century skills, and international competencies among learners.Enroll Now! ↗Ask about the program ElementaryJunior HighSenior HighLearning OptionsOpen High School SRIC BED-IBPElementary DepartmentEnriched with a strong focus on Creative Arts, this stage encourages imagination, self-expression, and confidence - building - laying a strong foundation for holistic child development.Explore this department → SRIC BED-IBPJunior High School DepartmentIntegrated with Business and Entrepreneurship subjects, this level introduces learners to essential business concepts and entrepreneurial mindsets early on, promoting financial literacy and innovation.Explore this department → SRIC BED-IBPSenior High School DepartmentFeatures a Professional Development Program that bridges basic education with future career paths, preparing students for success in higher education and to thrive both in local and international work environments.Academic TrackScience, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics (STEM)Humanities and Social Sciences (HUMMS) Hands-on Learning ActivitiesAccountancy, Business, and Management (ABM)General Academic Strand (GAS)Tech-Vocational TrackInformation and Communication Technology (ICT)Explore this department → FLEXIBLE LEARNINGLearning optionsTo serve diverse learner needs, SRIC BED-IBP offers flexible learning modalities, including:✓Traditional face-to-face instruction✓Hybrid/blended learning✓Fully online learning platforms ACCESSIBLE EDUCATIONOpen High School Program (OHSP)St. Robert’s International College Basic Education Department–IBP-SHS Southern Manila Consortium operates through the Open High School Program (OHSP), an alternative delivery mode offered to all learners both inside and outside the Philippines. This academic program, implemented in conjunction with the K–12 Curriculum, is designed for students who can adapt to various modes of instruction such as face-to-face classes, modular learning, independent study, and online learning systems. These flexible options ensure that education remains accessible, inclusive, and learner-centered for students across the Philippines and around the globe.Contact admissions →"
