        "text": "About Mic Up SRIC Awards and Recognition micup.html Search results Mic Up Address Quick Links Gallery Contact Us Visit Us Mic Up SRIC AWARDS AND RECOGNITION Mic Up – St. Robert’s International College English Speaking Competition · Wuxi, China ←→ St. Robert’s International College once again proved its commitment to excellence and global competitiveness as its talented student delegation proudly represented the Philippines at the Mic Up English Speaking Competition in Wuxi, China.The Mic Up Competition is an international platform that brings together young public speakers from around the world to showcase their skills in English communication, creative expression, and leadership. Among a diverse pool of participants, the Robertine team stood out — not only for their command of language but for their poise, passion, and purpose.SAGE World Cup 2016 wasn’t just about awards or recognition. It was about building a better future through socially responsible entrepreneurship. It was about connecting with youth leaders worldwide and showing that the Filipino spirit is a force for good.The Robertine delegation was composed of bright, driven students who embodied the values of excellence, courage, and global awareness. Each member delivered powerful speeches and presentations, reflecting both their personal growth and the strength of the school’s English-speaking and leadership programs. One of the standout performers, Ciara, earned international recognition for her compelling stage presence and eloquence — a proud moment that highlighted the team’s success and inspired the entire Robertine family.Their participation in the Mic Up Competition is a testament to the school's unwavering mission: to mold future-ready leaders who can rise to any challenge and speak with purpose."
