        "text": "Rajamangala University of Technology (RMUT Phra Nakhon & Isan), Thailand University Partners rmuti.html Search results Rajamangala University of Technology Phra Nakhon Rajamangala University of Technology Phra Nakhon A shared approach to professional learning Professional credits. Academic pathways. Connecting expertise and opportunity St. Roberts International College – St. Roberts Training and Management Center About the Council of Engineers Explore this educational partnership Address Quick Links Gallery Contact Us Visit Us Rajamangala University of Technology Phra Nakhon UNIVERSITY PARTNERS · THAILANDRajamangala University of Technology Phra NakhonA trusted Educational Partner of St. Roberts International CollegeExplore RMUTP ↗About the partnership ↓ RMUTP · Phra Nakhon PartnershipCredit pathwaysPartner rolesCouncil of Engineers WORKING TOGETHERA shared approach to professional learningRajamangala University of Technology Phra Nakhon (RMUTP), the Council of Engineers Thailand (COE), and Northwest Samar State University (NWSSU) have formalized a strategic partnership to enhance the Continuing Professional Development (CPD) program and the Digital Engineering program. This collaboration will enable students to enroll and earn their CPD from Northwest Samar State University, while the Council of Engineers Thailand will provide the program content. CONTINUING PROFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENTProfessional credits. Academic pathways.In addition to obtaining CPD credits, students will have the opportunity to earn credit units through the Credit Banking Program at Rajamangala University of Technology Phra Nakhon, which will contribute towards fulfilling their academic requirements for Master's or Doctoral degrees from Rajamangala University of Technology Phra Nakhon.01Program contentCouncil of Engineers Thailand02CPD creditsNorthwest Samar State University03Master’s & Doctoral degree creditsRajamangala University of Technology Phra Nakhon PARTNER ROLESConnecting expertise and opportunityTo summarize, the structure is as follows: the CPD program content comes from the Council of Engineers Thailand, the CPD credits are awarded by Northwest Samar State University, and the degree credits for the Master's and Doctoral programs are granted by Rajamangala University. Furthermore, St. Roberts International College – St. Roberts Training and Management Center will serve as the exclusive marketing partner for this collaboration, with a commitment to professionally highlight and promote the venture.St. Roberts International College – St. Roberts Training and Management CenterExclusive marketing partner for the collaboration. COUNCIL OF ENGINEERS THAILANDAbout the Council of EngineersThe Council of Engineers was established under the Engineering Act of 1999. It has the status of a juristic person. Its duties are to issue licenses to those practicing the controlled engineering profession, including considering the suspension or revocation of licenses, certifying degrees, certificates, or diplomas in the practice of controlled engineering, certifying knowledge and expertise in the practice of controlled engineering, including making recommendations to the Minister on the determination and cessation of controlled engineering branches and issuing regulations of the Council of Engineers with the approval of the Minister of Interior in the capacity of the Special President. LEARN MOREExplore this educational partnershipVisit RMUTP ↗Contact SRIC ↗"
