        "text": "About SRIC Awards and Recognition World School Summit worldsummit.html Search results World School Summit Address Quick Links Gallery Contact Us Visit Us World School Summit SRIC AWARDS AND RECOGNITION Most Innovative School March 16, 2024·Bangkok, Thailand ← → We are proud to announce that St. Robert’s International College has been awarded the title of Most Innovative School at the prestigious World School Summit, held in Bangkok, Thailand on March 16, 2024. This international recognition is a testament to the school’s commitment to educational transformation, creativity, and excellence in the 21st century.The award was proudly received by Dr. John Trevor A. Galindez, one of the school’s leading education visionaries and advocates for global competitiveness in learning. With great honor, he accepted the award on behalf of the entire Robertine community — a recognition that reflects years of innovation, teamwork, and unwavering dedication to quality education.At St. Robert’s International College, innovation is more than a buzzword — it’s embedded in every program, classroom, and initiative. From our International English Curriculum to our cutting-edge use of educational technology and student leadership development, we continue to break new ground in preparing learners for the demands of the future.This milestone would not have been possible without the collective efforts of our school officers, dedicated teachers, eager learners, and supportive parents. Each one has played a vital role in shaping an environment where innovation thrives and students flourish."
